<title>HUNGARY: Pannon-Flax boosts pre-tax profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Pannon-Flax boosts pre-tax profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Jan-Dec 1996	1996 results as</p>
<p>							 percentage</p>
<p>						     of 1995 figures</p>
<p>   Operating profit	    124.4	     87.9</p>
<p>   Pre-tax profit		 80.2	    267.4</p>
<p>   Net sales		   2,403.2	    130.9</p>
<p>   Other revenue		  28.9	     51.9</p>
<p>   Direct costs of sales   1,486.2	    130.8</p>
<p>   Indirect costs of sales   727.0	    144.9</p>
<p>   Net financial income	 48.8 loss	62.7</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	   2.3	    255.9</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure    51.0	     64.9</p>
<p>   Net extraordinary income    4.6		-</p>
<p>NOTE - Pannon-Flax Gyori Lenszovo Rt  is a textile industrial company. The figures are not audited and were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
